---
/**
 * Interlinear completo dos 105 versículos de 1 João.
 * SBLGNT CC BY 4.0; MorphGNT CC BY-SA 3.0; glosas auxiliares MACULA CC BY 4.0.
 * Veja src/data/1-joao-grego/NOTAS-EDITORIAIS.md.
 */
interface Props { chapter: number; verses: Record<string, string[][]>; book?: '1 João' | 'Hebreus' }
const {chapter, verses, book = '1 João'} = Astro.props;
---
<section
  class="original-panel"
  data-original-panel
  data-chapter={chapter}
  data-book={book}
  data-greek-data={JSON.stringify(verses)}
  hidden
  aria-labelledby="original-title"
>
  <div class="original-head">
    <span class="original-eyebrow">FERRAMENTA DE ESTUDO · GREGO KOINÉ</span>
    <h2 id="original-title" data-original-title>{book} — Texto original</h2>
    <p>Interlinear horizontal, palavra por palavra. O texto-base é a edição crítica SBLGNT.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="original-tabs" role="group" aria-label="Escolher modo do estudo do texto original">
    <button type="button" class="original-tab is-selected" data-original-tab="original" aria-pressed="true" aria-controls="original-pane-original">Texto original</button>
    <button type="button" class="original-tab" data-original-tab="transliteracao" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="original-pane-transliteracao">Transliteração</button>
    <button type="button" class="original-tab" data-original-tab="literal" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="original-pane-literal">Tradução literal</button>
    <button type="button" class="original-tab" data-original-tab="gramatica" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="original-pane-gramatica">Análise gramatical</button>
  </div>

  <div id="original-pane-original" class="original-pane" data-original-view="original">
    <p class="original-mode">Texto original <span>grego e glosa em português abaixo de cada palavra</span></p>
    <div class="greek-strip" data-original-strip="original" lang="grc"></div>
  </div>
  <div id="original-pane-transliteracao" class="original-pane" data-original-view="transliteracao" hidden>
    <p class="original-mode">Transliteração <span>forma grega e sua representação em caracteres latinos</span></p>
    <div class="greek-strip" data-original-strip="transliteracao"></div>
    <p class="original-remark">Transliteração acadêmica simplificada: <em>ē</em> = eta e <em>ō</em> = ômega. Não é uma transcrição fonética do grego moderno.</p>
  </div>
  <div id="original-pane-literal" class="original-pane" data-original-view="literal" hidden>
    <p class="original-mode">Tradução literal <span>correspondências lexicais na ordem do grego</span></p>
    <div class="greek-strip" data-original-strip="literal"></div>
    <p class="original-sentence"><strong>Sequência de glosas (não é tradução fluente):</strong> <span data-original-literal></span></p>
    <p class="original-remark">A sequência acima não substitui uma tradução contextual. A estrutura sintática, a flexão verbal e as possibilidades lexicais devem ser consideradas no estudo do versículo.</p>
  </div>
  <div id="original-pane-gramatica" class="original-pane" data-original-view="gramatica" hidden>
    <p class="original-mode">Análise gramatical <span>forma, lema, categoria e morfologia da SBLGNT/MorphGNT</span></p>
    <div class="grammar-scroll">
      <table class="grammar-table">
        <thead><tr><th>Nº</th><th>Forma grega</th><th>Lema</th><th>Morfologia</th><th>Glosa</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody data-original-grammar></tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="original-remark">Os códigos de lematização e morfologia seguem MorphGNT. A análise indica formas gramaticais, não determina isoladamente a função sintática ou a interpretação de cada palavra.</p>
  </div>

  <p class="original-counter" data-original-counter aria-live="polite"></p>
  <div class="original-foot">
    <p><strong>Texto:</strong> <a href="https://sblgnt.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">SBL Greek New Testament (SBLGNT)</a> — © 2010 Society of Biblical Literature e Logos Bible Software, <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CC BY 4.0</a>.</p>
    <p><strong>Lemas e morfologia:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/morphgnt/sblgnt" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MorphGNT 6.12</a> (James K. Tauber, ed., 2017), <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CC BY-SA 3.0</a>. Apoio às glosas: <a href="https://github.com/Clear-Bible/macula-greek" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MACULA Greek</a> (CC BY 4.0). Glosas portuguesas e transliteração adaptadas pelo Prima Scriptura. O sinal «—» indica glosa ainda não revisada; não deve ser interpretado como tradução.</p>
    <p data-original-text-note hidden={book !== '1 João'}><strong>Nota textual (1 João 5:7–8):</strong> o chamado <em>Comma Joanino</em> não consta do texto principal da edição crítica SBLGNT; a disposição dos versículos pode diferir de algumas traduções portuguesas.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<script>
  type GreekWord = [string, string, string, string, string, string];
  type GreekVerseData = Record<string, GreekWord[]>;
  const partOfSpeech: Record<string,string> = {
    'A-':'adjetivo / numeral','C-':'conjunção','D-':'advérbio','I-':'interjeição',
    'N-':'substantivo','P-':'preposição','RA':'artigo definido',
    'RD':'pronome demonstrativo','RI':'pronome interrogativo / indefinido',
    'RP':'pronome pessoal / reflexivo','RR':'pronome relativo',
    'V-':'verbo','X-':'partícula'
  };
  const tense:Record<string,string>={P:'presente',I:'imperfeito',F:'futuro',A:'aoristo',X:'perfeito',Y:'mais-que-perfeito'};
  const voice:Record<string,string>={A:'ativa',M:'média',P:'passiva'};
  const mood:Record<string,string>={I:'indicativo',D:'imperativo',S:'subjuntivo',O:'optativo',N:'infinitivo',P:'particípio'};
  const grammaticalCase:Record<string,string>={N:'nominativo',G:'genitivo',D:'dativo',A:'acusativo',V:'vocativo'};
  const number:Record<string,string>={S:'singular',P:'plural'};
  const gender:Record<string,string>={M:'masculino',F:'feminino',N:'neutro'};
  const degree:Record<string,string>={C:'comparativo',S:'superlativo'};

  function explainMorph(pos:string,code:string):string{
    const c=code.padEnd(8,'-');
    const details:string[]=[partOfSpeech[pos]||'categoria não identificada'];
    if(pos==='V-'){
      if(tense[c[1]])details.push(tense[c[1]]);
      if(mood[c[3]])details.push(mood[c[3]]);
      if(voice[c[2]])details.push('voz '+voice[c[2]]);
      if('123'.includes(c[0]))details.push(c[0]+'ª pessoa');
    }
    if(grammaticalCase[c[4]])details.push(grammaticalCase[c[4]]);
    if(number[c[5]])details.push(number[c[5]]);
    if(gender[c[6]])details.push(gender[c[6]]);
    if(degree[c[7]])details.push(degree[c[7]]);
    return details.join(' · ');
  }
  for(const panel of document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-original-panel]')){
    const chapter=Number(panel.dataset.chapter);
    const book=panel.dataset.book||'1 João';
    let verseData:GreekVerseData={};
    try{verseData=JSON.parse(panel.dataset.greekData||'{}') as GreekVerseData;}catch{verseData={};}
    // Os dados já estão incorporados à página estática: não é necessária rede externa.
    const tabs=Array.from(panel.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-original-tab]'));
    const views=Array.from(panel.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-original-view]'));
    const heading=panel.querySelector('[data-original-title]');
    const wordCount=panel.querySelector('[data-original-counter]');
    const textualNote=panel.querySelector('[data-original-text-note]');
    const literal=panel.querySelector('[data-original-literal]');
    const tbody=panel.querySelector<HTMLTableSectionElement>('[data-original-grammar]');

    function stripWord(word:GreekWord,mode:'original'|'transliteracao'|'literal'):HTMLDivElement{
      const token=document.createElement('div');
      token.className='greek-token';
      // Os tokens são criados em runtime; os seletores :global são essenciais no Astro.
      const greek=document.createElement('span');
      greek.className='greek';
      greek.lang='grc';
      greek.textContent=word[0];
      const gloss=document.createElement('span');
      gloss.className='gloss'+(mode==='transliteracao'?' translit':'');
      gloss.lang=mode==='transliteracao'?'en':'pt-BR';
      gloss.textContent=mode==='transliteracao'?word[5]:word[4];
      token.append(greek,gloss);
      token.title=word[1]+' · '+explainMorph(word[2],word[3]);
      return token;
    }
    function renderVerse(v:number){
      const words=verseData[String(v)];
      if(!words||!words.length)return;
      if(heading)heading.textContent=book+' '+chapter+':'+v+' — Texto original';
      if(wordCount)wordCount.textContent=words.length+' palavra'+(words.length!==1?'s':'')+' · SBLGNT · '+book+' '+chapter+':'+v;
      if(textualNote instanceof HTMLElement)textualNote.hidden=!(book==='1 João'&&chapter===5&&(v===7||v===8));
      for(const mode of ['original','transliteracao','literal'] as const){
        const target=panel.querySelector('[data-original-strip="'+mode+'"]');
        if(target)target.replaceChildren(...words.map(w=>stripWord(w,mode)));
      }
      if(tbody){
        const fragment=document.createDocumentFragment();
        words.forEach((word,index)=>{
          const row=document.createElement('tr');
          for(const [i,value] of [
            [0,String(index+1)],[1,word[0]],[2,word[1]],
            [3,explainMorph(word[2],word[3])],[4,word[4]]
          ] as [number,string][]){
            const td=document.createElement('td');
            if(i===1||i===2){td.className='greek';td.lang='grc';}
            td.textContent=value;
            row.append(td);
          }
          fragment.append(row);
        });
        tbody.replaceChildren(fragment);
      }
      if(literal){
        const sequential=words.map(w=>{
          const token=w[0],mark=token.match(/[,:;.!?··]$/u)?.[0]||'';
          return (w[4]==='—'?'[glosa em revisão]':w[4].split(';')[0].trim())+mark;
        }).join(' ');
        literal.textContent=sequential;
      }
    }
    panel.addEventListener('original-verse-change',()=>{
      const v=Number(panel.dataset.activeVerse);
      if(Number.isInteger(v))renderVerse(v);
    });
    panel.addEventListener('click',event=>{
      const clicked=event.target;
      if(!(clicked instanceof Element))return;
      const button=clicked.closest('button[data-original-tab]');
      if(!(button instanceof HTMLButtonElement)||!panel.contains(button))return;
      const mode=button.dataset.originalTab;
      if(!mode)return;
      for(const tab of tabs){
        const active=tab===button;
        tab.classList.toggle('is-selected',active);
        tab.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(active));
      }
      for(const view of views)view.hidden=view.dataset.originalView!==mode;
    });
    const initial=Number(panel.dataset.activeVerse);
    if(Number.isInteger(initial)&&initial>0)renderVerse(initial);
  }
</script>
<style>
.original-panel{max-width:790px;margin:8px 0 35px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d6d9dc;border-radius:14px;padding:28px;box-shadow:0 12px 36px #1429420b;scroll-margin-top:24px}
.original-panel[hidden],.original-pane[hidden],.original-foot p[hidden]{display:none!important}
.original-eyebrow{font:700 10px/1.5 Inter,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.15em;color:#98743d}
.original-head h2{font:700 23px/1.35 'Libre Baskerville',Georgia,serif;color:#17304d;margin:8px 0 9px}
.original-head p{font:400 13px/1.7 Inter,Arial,sans-serif;color:#607083;margin:0}
.original-tabs{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:25px 0 22px}
.original-tab{appearance:none;cursor:pointer;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #c9d4da;color:#244156;background:#f8f9f8;padding:10px 13px;font:600 12px/1.4 Inter,Arial,sans-serif}
.original-tab:hover{background:#f3ede2;border-color:#b69360}
.original-tab.is-selected{background:#17304d;color:#fff;border-color:#17304d}
.original-tab:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #b8935a;outline-offset:3px}
.original-mode{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;column-gap:14px;align-items:baseline;font:700 12px/1.5 Inter,Arial,sans-serif;color:#263e57;margin:0 0 13px}
.original-mode span{font-weight:400;color:#77828d}
.greek-strip{display:flex;align-items:stretch;gap:14px;overflow-x:auto;scrollbar-width:thin;overscroll-behavior-x:contain;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;padding:8px 2px 18px}
:global(.greek-token){display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;flex:0 0 auto;min-width:82px;min-height:96px;padding:14px 15px;border:1px solid #e2e7e9;border-radius:9px;background:#f7f9fa;gap:8px}
:global(.greek){font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif!important;font-size:27px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;color:#1c324e;white-space:nowrap}
:global(.greek-token) :global(.gloss){font:500 13px/1.55 Inter,Arial,sans-serif;color:#697688;white-space:nowrap}
:global(.greek-token) :global(.translit){font-style:italic;color:#7e6239}
.original-sentence{font:400 16px/1.75 Georgia,serif;background:#f4f0e8;color:#283e4c;padding:16px 18px;border-left:3px solid #b18e56;border-radius:3px;margin:17px 0 12px}
.original-remark{font:400 12.5px/1.75 Inter,Arial,sans-serif;color:#697586;margin:14px 0 0}
.grammar-scroll{overflow-x:auto;max-width:100%;border:1px solid #e2e5e7;border-radius:9px}
.grammar-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font:400 12.5px/1.6 Inter,Arial,sans-serif;color:#334a5d;text-align:left}
.grammar-table th{font:700 11px/1.5 Inter,Arial,sans-serif;background:#edf2f5;color:#29465e;padding:12px 13px;white-space:nowrap}
.grammar-table td{padding:11px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e9ed;vertical-align:top}
.grammar-table td:first-child{min-width:42px;text-align:center}
.grammar-table td:nth-child(2),.grammar-table td:nth-child(3){min-width:85px}
.grammar-table td:nth-child(4){min-width:245px}
.grammar-table td:nth-child(5){min-width:100px}
.grammar-table td:global(.greek){font-size:21px;line-height:1.45}
.original-counter{font:600 11px/1.6 Inter,Arial,sans-serif;color:#7b8390;margin:17px 0 0}
.original-foot{border-top:1px solid #e0e5e8;padding-top:17px;margin-top:21px}
.original-foot p{font:400 11.5px/1.85 Inter,Arial,sans-serif;color:#75808d;margin:0 0 9px}
.original-foot a{color:#78572d;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px}
@media(max-width:760px){.original-panel{padding:18px 15px}.original-head h2{font-size:20px}.original-tabs{gap:7px}.original-tab{font-size:11px;padding:9px 11px}:global(.greek){font-size:25px}:global(.greek-token){min-width:78px;padding:12px 13px}}
</style>